1
00:00:00,987 --> 00:00:06,197
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Over my dead body,
my son goes into outer space!

2
00:00:09,412 --> 00:00:11,162
(Bernadette:)I'm ready.

3
00:00:15,168 --> 00:00:16,878
(Leonard:)Let me see if I got this right.

4
00:00:17,045 --> 00:00:19,755
(Leonard:)You actually asked Bernadette
to leave your house?

5
00:00:19,923 --> 00:00:22,303
(Howard:)What choice did I have?
She went behind my back...

6
00:00:22,467 --> 00:00:24,677
(Howard:)...and turned
my own mother against me.

7
00:00:24,844 --> 00:00:27,014
(Raj:)Wow, you're not
only our first astronaut.

8
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:30,350
(Raj:)You're also the first one of us
to kick a girl out of bed.

9
00:00:32,685 --> 00:00:34,895
(Raj:)You're like a rock star.

10
00:00:36,105 --> 00:00:38,605
- Little bit, heh.
- I hate to say it...

